    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramen Crisis \u2013 The Wacky Ramen Delivery Action Game!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your scooter and get ready for the most ridiculous ramen delivery job ever! Stack your ramen sky-high and race to your customers without dropping a single noodle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is key\u2014get that ramen to the customer while it\u2019s still steaming hot! Oh, and don\u2019t forget the toppings\u2014seasoned eggs, chashu, and more make everything better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! The streets are full of wacky obstacles and crazy traps. Can you conquer them all and make the ultimate delivery?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes It Awesome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Physics Fun</strong> \u2013 Your ramen tower sways like crazy! Keep your balance and don\u2019t let it topple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.poster.avif?t=1753480700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.webm?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.mp4?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Chaos</strong> \u2013 Wild gimmicks and unpredictable mishaps turn every delivery into a laugh-out-loud adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.poster.avif?t=1753480700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.webm?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.mp4?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Toppings</strong> \u2013 Grab extra goodies like seasoned eggs, chashu, and dumplings on the way to earn happy customers and extra points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you deliver the ultimate bowl of ramen without making a mess? Time to find out!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramen Crisis \u2013 The Wacky Ramen Delivery Action Game!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your scooter and get ready for the most ridiculous ramen delivery job ever! Stack your ramen sky-high and race to your customers without dropping a single noodle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is key\u2014get that ramen to the customer while it\u2019s still steaming hot! Oh, and don\u2019t forget the toppings\u2014seasoned eggs, chashu, and more make everything better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! The streets are full of wacky obstacles and crazy traps. Can you conquer them all and make the ultimate delivery?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes It Awesome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Physics Fun</strong> \u2013 Your ramen tower sways like crazy! Keep your balance and don\u2019t let it topple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.poster.avif?t=1753480700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.webm?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/5eaa2eeee978ea79ce32e7db4c41b2d1.mp4?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Chaos</strong> \u2013 Wild gimmicks and unpredictable mishaps turn every delivery into a laugh-out-loud adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.poster.avif?t=1753480700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.webm?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627690/extras/fc5e66f91fdb3cc2487b0ff37927b231.mp4?t=1753480700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Toppings</strong> \u2013 Grab extra goodies like seasoned eggs, chashu, and dumplings on the way to earn happy customers and extra points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you deliver the ultimate bowl of ramen without making a mess? Time to find out!\u00a0</p>",
